  title: { uz: 'Listening: zaif bölim turi 1', en: 'Listening: weak section type 1' },
  intro: { uz: "LC kuni. 5-bosqiçda Listening maşqi umumiy emas — 4 mockda eng köp ball yöqotilgan BÖLIM turi (1/2/3/4) ustida. Bugun öşa bölim turi: kitobdan faqat şu turga öxşaş maşqlar.", en: 'LC day. In phase 5 Listening practice is not general — it targets the SECTION type (1/2/3/4) where most marks were lost across four mocks. Today: that section type only — book exercises that resemble it.' },
